{"id":"n76298-1-7","stage":5,"title":"진열 · 陈列","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76298-1-7-1","ko":"요즘 상점은 비슷한 물건끼리 진열이 되어 있어.","zh":"最近商店都是把类似的商品放在一起陈列的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"상점은","meaning":"商店","explanation":"상점：商店；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"상점","audio":"/audio/de9d31548e094efd2662.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16484","senseId":"1","lemma":"상점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상점은","audio":"/audio/f0846fee51fb0bb29719.mp3"}},{"text":"비슷한","meaning":"类似，相似，相近","explanation":"비슷하다：类似，相似，相近；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"비슷하다","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65864","senseId":"1","lemma":"비슷하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비슷한","audio":"/audio/10ac34fb72505fb6aec9.mp3"}},{"text":"물건끼리","meaning":"商品，物品","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；끼리：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건끼리","audio":"/audio/a047d80676c310d2c3e0.mp3"}},{"text":"진열이","meaning":"陈列","explanation":"진열：陈列；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"진열","audio":"/audio/6b76c596e6dcff828db5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76298","senseId":"1","lemma":"진열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진열이","audio":"/audio/bf5e771ba9c7d90e24ad.mp3"}},{"text":"되어","meaning":"形成，完成","explanation":"되다：形成，完成；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"12","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되어","audio":"/audio/50e84bc2da43dfbd09ba.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"de9d31548e094efd","term":"상점","zh":"商店","audio":"/audio/de9d31548e094efd2662.mp3","entryId":"16484","definition":"销售东西的店铺。","pronunciation":["상점"]},{"id":"9903f9b7bf915b82","term":"비슷하다","zh":"类似，相似，相近","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3","entryId":"65864","definition":"两种或两种以上的大小、模样、状态及性质等虽不完全相同，但有很多相像之处。","pronunciation":["비스타다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"商品，物品","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"6b76c596e6dcff82","term":"진열","zh":"陈列","audio":"/audio/6b76c596e6dcff828db5.mp3","entryId":"76298","definition":"为了给众人看，把物品摆放出来。","pronunciation":["지ː녈"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"形成，完成","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事物或现象产生或被制造。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f29138ef3210e97374ed.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76298-1-7-2","ko":"그래야 사람들이 손쉽게 찾을 수 있지.","zh":"这样人们才能更方便地找到它们。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래야","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래야","audio":"/audio/cbcac572d7fdccbe8645.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"손쉽게","meaning":"容易，轻松","explanation":"손쉽다：容易，轻松；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"손쉽다","audio":"/audio/8a6813e41d0e9d5d8ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15603","senseId":"1","lemma":"손쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손쉽게","audio":"/audio/fd8cd28d0932ad27f860.mp3"}},{"text":"찾을","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾을","audio":"/audio/17cf5f5f6b87a5064405.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있지.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있지","audio":"/audio/6af127780f763fcd960b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"8a6813e41d0e9d5d","term":"손쉽다","zh":"容易，轻松","audio":"/audio/8a6813e41d0e9d5d8ac3.mp3","entryId":"15603","definition":"事情处理或操作不难。","pronunciation":["손쉽따"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2acccefd16ced8859b27.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.553,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76298","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这样人们才能更方便地找到它们。","最近商店都是把类似的商品放在一起陈列的。","没有房子的普通人的苦衷，上层阶级是很难理解的。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近商店都是把类似的商品放在一起陈列的。","没有房子的普通人的苦衷，上层阶级是很难理解的。","这样人们才能更方便地找到它们。"],"answer":2}]}
